{# VARIANT v2_symmetric — gp-2 core: remove the command asymmetry.

   Identical to production vote_ballot.j2 EXCEPT the decision rules: the
   baseline makes SKIP a HARD command, eject a SOFT suggestion, licenses the
   graph-as-prior override, and supplies a cascade excuse — the structure that
   lets the model rationalize its way to SKIP (F1). This variant makes ejecting
   a clear suspect and skipping when unclear EQUALLY weighted, drops the
   override-license and the cascade excuse, and names both error types as
   equally costly. No rendered verdict (the model still does the comparison) so
   this isolates the asymmetry effect.
#}
